  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v3.5.6: Simulcast-capable typed parameters on `RTCRtpSender.GetParameters`/`SetParameters`. 7 new WebRTC dictionary types (`RTCRtpSendParameters`, `RTCRtpParameters`, `RTCRtpEncodingParameters`, `RTCRtpCodingParameters`, `RTCRtpCodecParameters`, `RTCRtpHeaderExtensionParameters`, `RTCRtcpParameters`) replace the untyped `JSObject` return shape. Consumers can now introspect + mutate per-encoding simulcast layers (`encodings[i].maxBitrate`, `scaleResolutionDownBy`, `active`, `scalabilityMode`) strongly-typed. Wrapper count: 1014 → 1021.",
